<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Shanghai</p>
<p>Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>8-Alexander Volkov (Russia) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 7-5</p>
<p>7-Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Leander Paes (India) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Tomas Nydahl (Sweden)/Stefano Pescosolido (Italy) beat Slava</p>
<p>Dosedel (Czech Republic)/Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Max Myrnyi (Belarus)/Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) beat David</p>
<p>Ekerot (Sweden)/Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 7-6 (8-6) 3-6 7-6 (8-6).</p>
</text>
